# CONSULT-75 — Shim-side state enumeration (`JuceMiles.cpp`)

Structs are defined at ```73:123:D:/Code/Galaxies-Reborn/swg-source-x64-dx11/src/engine/client/library/clientAudio/src/win32/JuceMiles.cpp```. Default `SampleState`: `status = SMP_DONE` (114), `totalFrames = 0` (82), empty `pcm` (80), `completed = false` (113), `cursorFrame = 0.0` (84), `ownerStream = nullptr` (112).

